  "drainedPredicate": "Fenced CPU candidate query is deployed and lifecycle flag acknowledged closed; exactly one matching cron has nextRun.state.type=pending; complete indexed separately scheduled job census has no inProgress or unknown state. Missing/unreadable/unknown/truncated state blocks. Per-workspace attach, teardown and disk resize IDs plus replacement continuations must also settle. Pending future CPU jobs will receive no candidates while the same fence remains closed.",
